{
  "uid": "vps-overview",
  "title": "VPS · visión general",
  "description": "Portada del VPS de Paufer, Gast-On y Multas. Generado por grafana/tools/gen_vps_dashboard.py: no se edita desde la interfaz (se pierde).",
  "tags": [
    "infra",
    "vps"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "app",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(probe_success, app)",
          "refId": "app"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(probe_success, app)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Estado general",
      "description": "Resumen de las 6 sondas HTTP (web y API de las tres apps). Verde = todas responden; rojo = al menos una falla. Una caída corta (un redeploy dura ~1 min) se ve rojo aquí pero NO avisa: la alerta ServicioCaido espera 2 minutos seguidos.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min(probe_success)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "● HAY SERVICIOS CAÍDOS",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "● TODO OK",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "$app",
      "description": "Web y API de esta app, vistas como las ve un usuario (blackbox, cada 30 s). Las tarjetas salen de la etiqueta app de las sondas (prometheus.yml).",
      "repeat": "app",
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "maxPerRow": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "probe_success{app=\"$app\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{tier}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CAÍDO",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Estado, última ventana de tiempo",
      "description": "Cada fila es una sonda; verde = responde, rojo = falla. Sirve para ver de un vistazo CUÁNDO cayó algo y CUÁNTO duró, cosa que un número suelto no dice. Un corte de ~1 minuto coincide con un despliegue.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "probe_success",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} · {{tier}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CAÍDO",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "alignValue": "center",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "RAM libre",
      "description": "RAM realmente aprovechable (MemAvailable: cuenta la caché que el kernel puede soltar, no solo la 'libre') sobre el total. El VPS no tiene swap: al agotarse, el kernel mata procesos. Rojo por debajo del ~8 % = los 300 MB de la alerta MemoriaDisponibleBaja.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.08
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "CPU en uso",
      "description": "Porcentaje de CPU en uso (todos los núcleos) en los últimos 5 min. El VPS tiene 2 vCPU; los picos cortos al generar un horario (solver OR-Tools) son normales. Lo preocupante es un nivel alto sostenido. Sin alerta todavía: el umbral se decidirá con datos reales.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.6
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Disco /",
      "description": "Porcentaje usado del disco raíz. Es compartido por las bases de datos de las tres apps y por las imágenes de Docker. Sin alerta todavía: este panel es el primer aviso visual.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay|squashfs\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay|squashfs\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Certificado (días)",
      "description": "Días que le quedan al certificado más próximo a caducar. Let's Encrypt dura 90 días y Traefik renueva hacia los 30: lo normal es 30-90. Bajo 14 días (alerta CertificadoPorCaducar) es que la renovación falla en silencio.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min((probe_ssl_earliest_cert_expiry - time()) / 86400)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "d",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 90,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 14
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 21
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Detalle",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 9,
          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "Tiempo de respuesta",
          "description": "Cuánto tarda cada URL en contestar (redirecciones y TLS incluidos). Medido desde el propio VPS: es el tiempo de Traefik + app, sin la red de internet. Una subida sostenida suele anticipar un problema de RAM o CPU. El timeout de la sonda es 10 s.",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 21,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 8
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              },
              "expr": "probe_duration_seconds",
              "legendFormat": "{{app}} · {{tier}}",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "s",
              "min": 0,
              "color": {
                "mode": "palette-classic"
              },
              "custom": {
                "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                "lineWidth": 2,
                "fillOpacity": 10,
                "gradientMode": "opacity",
                "showPoints": "never"
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom",
              "showLegend": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "Memoria por contenedor (los 8 mayores)",
          "description": "RAM de cada contenedor (working set), los 8 que más usan. Los nombres son los de Coolify (backend-g7r8rl4s…): pendiente de mapearlos a cada app con las etiquetas que ponga Coolify en el VPS.",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 12,
            "y": 21,
            "w": 12,
            "h": 8
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              },
              "expr": "topk(8, container_memory_working_set_bytes{name!=\"\"})",
              "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "bytes",
              "min": 0,
              "color": {
                "mode": "palette-classic"
              },
              "custom": {
                "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                "lineWidth": 2,
                "fillOpacity": 10,
                "gradientMode": "opacity",
                "showPoints": "never"
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom",
              "showLegend": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "type": "stat",
          "title": "Reinicios por contenedor (última hora)",
          "description": "Cuántas veces ha arrancado cada contenedor en la última hora. 0 es lo sano. Un redeploy crea contenedores con nombre nuevo, así que no cuenta. 3 o más en 10 min es el bucle de reinicios de Gast-On del 2026-09-25 (alerta ContenedorEnBucleDeReinicios).",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29,
            "w": 24,
            "h": 5
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              },
              "expr": "changes(container_start_time_seconds{name!=\"\"}[1h])",
              "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
              "refId": "A",
              "instant": true,
              "range": false
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "none",
              "thresholds": {
                "mode": "absolute",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "color": "green",
                    "value": null
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "orange",
                    "value": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "red",
                    "value": 3
                  }
                ]
              },
              "color": {
                "mode": "thresholds"
              }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "colorMode": "background",
            "graphMode": "none",
            "textMode": "value_and_name",
            "justifyMode": "center",
            "reduceOptions": {
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull"
              ],
              "fields": "",
              "values": false
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
